ices":22},"Become a Self-Employed Courier in Leeds | Evri Careers","Start delivering parcels in your area as a self-employed courier in Leeds. Discover your ultimate work life balance with our Evri Plus and Evri Flex.","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fleeds-courier-jobs",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"Z69dwREAAFJZFY9q","subpath1",[],"en-gb","careers","2025-02-14T15:14:36+0000","Document","01565e41-9d75-4f78-ab76-fc9a7d76336f",false,{"link_type":18},[23,59,89,107,128,207,242,282,332,368],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":27,"id":57,"slice_type":58,"slice_label":41},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[],{"theme":28,"PageHeaderTitle":29,"PageHeaderText":30,"PageHeaderCtaText":36,"PageHeaderCtaUrl":37,"secondaryCtaText":41,"secondaryCtaLabel":41,"secondaryCtaUrl":42,"PageHeaderImage":44,"heroImage":55,"videoContent":56,"showPremiumLogo":20},"standard","Leeds needs couriers – join the Evri community",[31],{"type":32,"text":33,"spans":34,"direction":35},"paragraph","We’re on the lookout for friendly, reliable couriers in Leeds to help deliver parcels to local communities – and bring a little joy to doorsteps every day.",[],"ltr","Apply today",{"link_type":38,"key":39,"url":40},"Web","09508e80-747d-4c70-8f80-7f0bc5f1b724","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fcourier-app.hermescloud.co.uk\u002Fauth\u002Findex-old",null,{"link_type":43},"Any",{"dimensions":45,"alt":48,"copyright":41,"url":49,"id":50,"edit":51},{"width":46,"height":47},300,48,"Courier","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Feff4a723-3b6d-4211-ba31-e8279db0bdf5_courier.svg","YhYpMBIAACsA0QBu",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$84a21c7a-efab-4e21-a8d5-6855999f9cc4","page_header",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":60,"primary":61,"id":87,"slice_type":88,"slice_label":41},[],{"CardImage":62,"CardAvatar":71,"CardTitle":72,"CardText":73,"ButtonText":84,"ButtonUrl":85,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":63,"alt":66,"copyright":41,"url":67,"id":68,"edit":69},{"width":64,"height":65},1000,665,"An Evri Courier is walking down the street in a residential area with a parcel under his arm.","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69xb5bqstJ9-pU1_EVRI_LOCATION_01_0782.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69xb5bqstJ9-pU1",{"x":52,"y":70,"zoom":53,"background":54},8,"none","Deliver parcels as a self-employed courier in Leeds",[74,81],{"type":32,"text":75,"spans":76,"direction":35},"Parcel deliveries are an essential part of life in the 21st century – but it doesn’t work without enthusiastic couriers to take care of that final mile. With a population of over 812,000, Leeds rarely slows down – and that's why we need your support. ",[77],{"start":78,"end":79,"type":80},179,186,"strong",{"type":32,"text":82,"spans":83,"direction":35},"Choose a delivery volume that works for you, stick to a route you know, and enjoy the freedom to fit work around your life. Join over 25,000 couriers already delivering with Evri – and start earning on your terms. ",[],"Get started today",{"link_type":38,"key":86,"url":40},"333f3154-ff2b-42d1-a5b8-ce11738aed77","card$206537e2-53d7-4d5e-b431-14099430e62b","card",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":90,"primary":91,"id":105,"slice_type":106,"slice_label":41},[],{"title":92,"bodyText":93,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":97,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":41,"buttonLink":98,"image":99},"The more you deliver, the more you earn",[94],{"type":32,"text":95,"spans":96,"direction":35},"It’s really that simple.  Our couriers are paid per parcel, so you can take on as many as you like. As you get to know your route, you’ll naturally speed up your deliveries – freeing up more time to boost your earnings even further. ",[],true,{"link_type":43},{"dimensions":100,"alt":101,"copyright":41,"url":102,"id":103,"edit":104},{"width":64,"height":65},"An Evri Courier closing their boot after retrieving the correct parcel for a delivery","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6pDe5bqstJ9-cfR_EVRI_LOCATION_04_3848.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6pDe5bqstJ9-cfR",{"x":52,"y":70,"zoom":53,"background":54},"feature_banner$1f4c9610-d4b2-4118-9f8a-7b863c58b99b","feature_banner",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":108,"primary":124,"id":126,"slice_type":127,"slice_label":41},[109,114,119],{"title":110,"content":111,"isNumbered":97,"icon":112,"image":113},"An iOS or Android smartphone",[],{},{},{"title":115,"content":116,"isNumbered":97,"icon":117,"image":118},"Proof of Right to work self-employed in the United Kingdom",[],{},{},{"title":120,"content":121,"isNumbered":97,"icon":122,"image":123},"Access to a car or van with licence and business insurance",[],{},{},{"theme":28,"title":125,"description":41,"showPaddingTop":20},"3 things you'll need to apply...","list_block$90977045-860b-4bee-91a4-80c387bf43fb","list_block",{"variation":129,"version":25,"items":130,"primary":197,"id":205,"slice_type":206,"slice_label":41},"3Column",[131,159,178],{"Title":132,"Description":137,"Image":141,"Label":41,"UrlText":147,"Url":148,"buttonDataGtmTrack":41,"SecondaryButtonText":41,"SecondaryButtonUrl":158,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":41,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[133],{"type":134,"text":135,"spans":136,"direction":35},"heading3","Evri Flex ",[],[138],{"type":32,"text":139,"spans":140,"direction":35},"Start delivering with Evri Flex and work on your terms. Fit deliveries around your life, set your availability in the app, and take on rounds when it suits you. All you need is a medium to large vehicle and a smartphone – the more you deliver, the more you earn. ",[],{"dimensions":142,"alt":143,"copyright":41,"url":144,"id":145,"edit":146},{"width":64,"height":65},"An Evri Courier is conversing with a recipient at their doorstep in a block of flats after a successful parcel delivery.","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ692_pbqstJ9-pYj_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4788.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z692_pbqstJ9-pYj",{"x":52,"y":70,"zoom":53,"background":54},"Find out more",{"id":149,"type":150,"tags":151,"lang":15,"slug":152,"first_publication_date":153,"last_publication_date":154,"uid":155,"url":156,"link_type":18,"key":157,"isBroken":20},"Z3gRrhAAACIAs1cN","content-page",[],"becoming-a-self-employed-courier--how-does-it-work--evri","2025-01-03T16:42:18+0000","2026-05-11T08:00:39+0000","become-a-courier-how-it-works","\u002Fcareers\u002Fbecome-a-courier-how-it-works","4c663790-8b75-401a-b77f-a426fd803777",{"link_type":43},{"Title":160,"Description":164,"Image":168,"Label":41,"UrlText":147,"Url":174,"buttonDataGtmTrack":41,"SecondaryButtonText":41,"SecondaryButtonUrl":177,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":41,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[161],{"type":134,"text":162,"spans":163,"direction":35},"Evri Plus",[],[165],{"type":32,"text":166,"spans":167,"direction":35},"Evri Plus gives you the perks of employment with the freedom of self-employment. Commit to 5+ days a week and unlock paid holiday, pension contributions, guaranteed earnings above NLW, and more – all while staying in control of your schedule. ",[],{"dimensions":169,"alt":170,"copyright":41,"url":171,"id":172,"edit":173},{"width":64,"height":65},"An Evri courier in high vis is smiling posing towards the camera with a parcel under their arm. The backdrop is a street of terraced houses in a rural British neighbourhood.","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69x25bqstJ9-pVF",{"x":52,"y":70,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"id":149,"type":150,"tags":175,"lang":15,"slug":152,"first_publication_date":153,"last_publication_date":154,"uid":155,"url":156,"link_type":18,"key":176,"isBroken":20},[],"5e9d76d1-bb35-4a2f-a4e2-8b4ddf06531c",{"link_type":43},{"Title":179,"Description":183,"Image":187,"Label":41,"UrlText":147,"Url":193,"buttonDataGtmTrack":41,"SecondaryButtonText":41,"SecondaryButtonUrl":196,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":41,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[180],{"type":134,"text":181,"spans":182,"direction":35},"Business owner",[],[184],{"type":32,"text":185,"spans":186,"direction":35},"Train and co-ordinate your own team of couriers delivering Evri parcels across Leeds. Work with a dedicated Evri Territory Manager to grow your business and be in control of parcel deliveries in your area.  ",[],{"dimensions":188,"alt":189,"copyright":41,"url":190,"id":191,"edit":192},{"width":64,"height":65},"A female Evri van driver poses in the driving seat of her blue Evri van.","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zBVJbqstJ9-iOw_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9817.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zBVJbqstJ9-iOw",{"x":52,"y":70,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"id":149,"type":150,"tags":194,"lang":15,"slug":152,"first_publication_date":153,"last_publication_date":154,"uid":155,"url":156,"link_type":18,"key":195,"isBroken":20},[],"aaa7667c-7ac3-45ac-9e4a-2c39297182e2",{"link_type":43},{"SectionTitle":198,"SectionDescription":203,"theme":204},[199],{"type":200,"text":201,"spans":202,"direction":35},"heading2","Choose a courier lifestyle to suit your needs ",[],[],"neutral","article_link_module$c424cf91-45b9-47b4-98de-c499adebdf46","article_link_module",{"variation":208,"version":25,"items":209,"primary":210,"id":241,"slice_type":88,"slice_label":41},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":71,"CardTitle":211,"CardText":212,"ButtonText":238,"ButtonUrl":239,"IsEco":20},"How to get started",[213,216,220,223,226,229,232,235],{"type":32,"text":214,"spans":215,"direction":35},"The best way to apply to be an Evri courier is via our Courier Community App, which will guide you through the process, from application to delivery training. You’ll also get access to our online marketplace where you can find work in your local area. ",[],{"type":217,"text":218,"spans":219,"direction":35},"o-list-item","Submit your application ",[],{"type":217,"text":221,"spans":222,"direction":35},"Book yourself onto an introductory training session ",[],{"type":217,"text":224,"spans":225,"direction":35},"Complete the pre-delivery training videos ",[],{"type":217,"text":227,"spans":228,"direction":35},"Sign the contract ",[],{"type":217,"text":230,"spans":231,"direction":35},"Set your profile ",[],{"type":217,"text":233,"spans":234,"direction":35},"Provide your bank details to get paid ",[],{"type":217,"text":236,"spans":237,"direction":35},"Find opportunities in your area ",[],"Submit your application today",{"link_type":38,"key":240,"url":40},"77b1aea8-b1ca-46a9-b3cc-a2d2fa4081ca","card$c626a667-85d1-4a25-bb7b-fce1f295613e",{"variation":243,"version":25,"items":244,"primary":267,"id":280,"slice_type":281,"slice_label":41},"darkBannerLeftImageAppStore",[245,257],{"appDownloadLogoImage":246,"appDownloadLogoAriaLabel":41,"appDownloadLogoLink":254},{"dimensions":247,"alt":250,"copyright":41,"url":251,"id":252,"edit":253},{"width":248,"height":249},140,42,"Download on the App Store","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F1ed957a3-786e-4aec-8062-fbfc9623ef48_app-store-white.svg","YinytBIAAC4AjoLX",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"link_type":38,"key":255,"url":256},"1b96c855-2747-4d38-9b73-5765b0cb0a3c","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fapps.apple.com\u002Fgb\u002Fapp\u002Fhermes-courier-community\u002Fid1568298035",{"appDownloadLogoImage":258,"appDownloadLogoAriaLabel":41,"appDownloadLogoLink":264},{"dimensions":259,"alt":260,"copyright":41,"url":261,"id":262,"edit":263},{"width":248,"height":249},"Get it on Google Play","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd119a56a-6383-4e8e-90ef-9a13f7255f7f_google-play-white.svg","YinytBIAAC8AjoLZ",{"x":52,"y":52,"zoom":53,"background":54},{"link_type":38,"key":265,"url":266},"dd686e6a-108c-43c5-b46d-07b9df94c5cc","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fplay.google.com\u002Fstore\u002Fapps\u002Fdetails?id=com.hermescourier.app",{"theme":28,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":41,"label_theme":268,"titleH2":269,"bodyText":270,"image":274,"showAppDownloadLogo":97},"Core","Download the Courier Community App for the easiest way to apply",[271],{"type":32,"text":272,"spans":273,"direction":35},"Begin your application today and become part of our team of over 25,000 active couriers. Once you're on board, you can use the platform to connect with fellow couriers, sharing news, ideas, and experiences, and contributing to a vibrant community eager to welcome you.",[],{"dimensions":275,"alt":276,"copyright":41,"url":277,"id":278,"edit":279},{"width":64,"height":65},"A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and smiling at their screen.","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5611.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6XtDJbqstJ9-WfQ",{"x":52,"y":70,"zoom":53,"background":54},"landing_feature_banner$1afa1149-359e-4376-ad95-6aff9cc37d46","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":283,"version":25,"items":284,"primary":285,"id":331,"slice_type":281,"slice_label":41},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":204,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":41,"label_theme":268,"titleH2":286,"bodyText":287,"image":320,"rightImage":20,"buttonText":41,"buttonLink":329,"buttonDataGtmTrack":41,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":330,"secondary_button_external":20},"Our people promises to our couriers",[288,293,296,301,304,309,312,317],{"type":32,"text":289,"spans":290,"direction":35},"Work in a way that suits you ",[291],{"start":52,"end":292,"type":80},28,{"type":32,"text":294,"spans":295,"direction":35},"We'll help fit your work schedule around personal commitments. Discover your ultimate work-life balance and turn your busy schedule into a well-oiled machine. ",[],{"type":32,"text":297,"spans":298,"direction":35},"Make a positive difference in your community ",[299],{"start":52,"end":300,"type":80},44,{"type":32,"text":302,"spans":303,"direction":35},"Provide a reliable, accurate and efficient service that our millions of customers depend on. You'll be an ambassador for the Evri brand – and our clients’ brands – in your local community. ",[],{"type":32,"text":305,"spans":306,"direction":35},"You’re in control ",[307],{"start":52,"end":308,"type":80},17,{"type":32,"text":310,"spans":311,"direction":35},"Once you’re onboarded, we’ll trust you to do the work in your own time, using your own equipment. You’ll be running your own business, and we’ll work with you to build it.  ",[],{"type":32,"text":313,"spans":314,"direction":35},"Be a part of something bigger ",[315],{"start":52,"end":316,"type":80},29,{"type":32,"text":318,"spans":319,"direction":35},"Connect to fellow couriers over the Courier Community App. This will keep you up to date with relevant information and give you access to training, resources and connections to colleagues at Evri head office, allowing you to carry out your deliveries every day stress-free. ",[],{"dimensions":321,"alt":324,"copyright":41,"url":325,"id":326,"edit":327},{"width":322,"height":323},2000,1300,"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C70%2C8192%2C5325&w=2000&h=1300","Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh",{"x":52,"y":328,"zoom":53,"background":54},70,{"link_type":43},{"link_type":43},"landing_feature_banner$b623d5ac-0531-4298-aedf-6e134e0e87cf",{"variation":283,"version":25,"items":333,"primary":334,"id":367,"slice_type":281,"slice_label":41},[],{"theme":28,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":41,"label_theme":268,"titleH2":335,"bodyText":336,"image":356,"rightImage":97,"buttonText":363,"buttonLink":364,"buttonDataGtmTrack":41,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":366,"secondary_button_external":20},"Sign up today and get started as a courier in Leeds",[337,340,344,347,350,353],{"type":32,"text":338,"spans":339,"direction":35},"There’s something for everyone as an Evri courier, so whether you’re looking for a simple side hustle or a full-time gig, we’ve got you covered. It’s quick and easy to apply to work and develop a career in this growing industry. All you need is: ",[],{"type":341,"text":342,"spans":343,"direction":35},"list-item","A full, clean driving licence ",[],{"type":341,"text":345,"spans":346,"direction":35},"You must be over 18 ",[],{"type":341,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":35},"Access to a vehicle ",[],{"type":341,"text":351,"spans":352,"direction":35},"The right to work in the UK ",[],{"type":341,"text":354,"spans":355,"direction":35},"No unspent criminal convictions ",[],{"dimensions":357,"alt":358,"copyright":41,"url":359,"id":360,"edit":361},{"width":322,"height":323},"A woman is sat at home at her desk smiling looking at her laptop screen. She is also on the phone.","leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdDpbqstJ9-ine_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7864.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C133%2C8192%2C5325&w=2000&h=1300","Z6zdDpbqstJ9-ine",{"x":52,"y":362,"zoom":53,"background":54},133,"Get started as a courier",{"link_type":38,"key":365,"url":40},"f1ff0e89-4dec-4ce3-abaa-fc42a7f40fee",{"link_type":43},"landing_feature_banner$81383c03-3c9e-4ebb-9471-7d288370f73a",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":369,"primary":416,"id":418,"slice_type":419,"slice_label":41},[370,384,390,399,405],{"questionTitle":371,"questionBody":372},"I’m having problems submitting my application. What should I do?",[373],{"type":32,"text":374,"spans":375,"direction":35},"First, try switching to a different browser (like Chrome, Safari, or Edge) or use your mobile device. If the issue continues, please email courier.recruitment@evri.com and our team will be happy to help. ",[376,383],{"start":377,"end":378,"type":379,"data":380},139,167,"hyperlink",{"link_type":38,"url":381,"target":382},"mailto:courier.recruitment@evri.com","_blank",{"start":377,"end":378,"type":80},{"questionTitle":385,"questionBody":386},"What are the working hours for the role?",[387],{"type":32,"text":388,"spans":389,"direction":35},"As a self-employed courier working hours can be flexible depending on factors such as your availability, the location of your round, and the number of parcels that particular round generates. On average a courier works approximately 5-6 hours a day. ",[],{"questionTitle":391,"questionBody":392},"How will I be paid?",[393,396],{"type":32,"text":394,"spans":395,"direction":35},"Couriers are paid on a monthly basis via BACS. All payments made by Evri to the courier will be without deductions of things like income tax for which you are responsible. ",[],{"type":32,"text":397,"spans":398,"direction":35},"Invoices are accessible through the dedicated link in the Courier Community App. ",[],{"questionTitle":400,"questionBody":401},"Do I need additional insurance?",[402],{"type":32,"text":403,"spans":404,"direction":35},"As a self-employed courier you must have the correct level of 3rd party cover whilst you’re out making deliveries. Evri has developed a ‘top-up’ insurance with Marsh Insurance. Charged at £1.35 per day and only on the days that service is provided to Evri, this gives the 3rd party cover required for Self Employed Couriers whilst making deliveries and collections on behalf of Evri and our clients. (full details can be provided upon request). ",[],{"questionTitle":406,"questionBody":407},"Can't find your question here?",[408],{"type":32,"text":409,"spans":410,"direction":35},"Check out our dedicated courier FAQ directory ",[411,415],{"start":52,"end":412,"type":379,"data":413},45,{"link_type":38,"url":414,"target":382},"leeds-courier-jobs.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fbecome-a-courier-faq",{"start":52,"end":412,"type":80},{"title":417},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$c5d1e8f7-5f17-4bf0-ab90-2fc7047a3f44","frequently_asked_questions",[23,59,89,107,128,207,242,282,332,368],["Reactive",422],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":423,"$sclients":489,"$sglobal-basket-count":41},{"abtasty":424,"accessibe":427,"appPromoBanner":430,"autoDivertUpdates":433,"awin":436,"bulkInternational":439,"bulkSendEnabled":442,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":445,"enableBasketCount":448,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":451,"euCustomsDuty":454,"groovyAdvert":457,"newInternationalSendFlow":460,"newinternationalpages":467,"oohPreferenceFlag":471,"opentel":474,"premium":477,"savedCards":480,"smallParcelSize":483,"yourPricesDrawer":486},{"_createdAt":425,"_updatedAt":426,"enabled":97},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":428,"_updatedAt":429,"enabled":97},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":431,"_updatedAt":432,"enabled":20},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":434,"_updatedAt":435,"enabled":20},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":437,"_updatedAt":438,"enabled":20},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":440,"_updatedAt":441,"enabled":97},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":443,"_updatedAt":444,"enabled":97},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-05T12:32:29.563Z",{"_createdAt":446,"_updatedAt":447,"enabled":97},"2024-11-14T16:09:05.362Z","2024-11-21T10:37:32.927Z",{"_createdAt":449,"_updatedAt":450,"enabled":97},"2025-10-28T13:17:38.716Z","2026-04-14T10:49:05.879Z",{"_createdAt":452,"_updatedAt":45